---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const title = "1Only Host - Reliable Web Hosting & Domain Services Provider";
const description = "1Only Host offers premium web hosting and domain services, providing fast, secure, and affordable solutions for businesses and individuals. Get started today!";
const keywords = "web hosting, domain services, reliable hosting, affordable hosting, secure hosting, domain registration, website hosting, cloud hosting, 1Only Host hosting, best web hosting, fast hosting services";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} keywords={keywords}>
  <div class="hero-banner-eight bg-twelve z-1 position-relative pt-130 pb-160 xl-pb-140 md-p0 mesh-bg-1" data-aos="fade-in">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xl-6 col-lg-7 col-md-10">
          <h1 class="hero-heading ">Bulk <span> Domain </span> Transfer .</h1>
          <p class="fs-28  font-manrope pt-25 pb-25 pe-xxl-5">Enter each domain name on a separate line. Please ensure that you include the extension i.e. "domainname.ext". Example: domain1.com,test domain2.com,test domain3.net,test domain4.com,test domain5.biz,test</p>
          <div>
            <form action="#" class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between flex-wrap mb-15">
              <input type="name" placeholder="Domain Name..">
              <button>Search Domain</button>
            </form>
            <ul class="style-none d-flex flex-wrap">
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="15" viewBox="0 0 18 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M1 8.28571L7 13L16.8571 1" stroke="#252525" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                </svg>
                No Card required</li>
              <li>
                <svg width="20" height="15" viewBox="0 0 18 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                  <path d="M1 8.28571L7 13L16.8571 1" stroke="#252525" stroke-width="2.5"/>
                </svg>
                14 Days Free Trial</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
          <div class="illustration"> <img src="/images/domain_trans_img.png" alt=""> </div>
      </div>
      
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="block-feature-twentyFive ">
    <div class="container lg">
      <div class="border-top border-bottom border-white border-2  pb-90 lg-pb-40">
        
        <div class="row gx-xxl-5">

          <div class="col-12">
            <div class="card-style-twelve text-start"> 
              <h4 class="theme-color">Note:</h4>
              <ul class="features list-check-two text-start">
                  <li>The following domain name extensions are not supported for registration from here: .NYC, .FOUNDATION, .FR, .BERpN, .EU, .ES, .DE, .CO, .CN, .CA, .NET.BR, .BLOG.BR, .ADV.BR, .ENG.BR, .ART.BR, .IND.BR, .ECO.BR, .ARQ.BR, .PRO.BR, .WIKI.BR, .MUS.BR, .COM.CO, .NET.CO, .NOM.CO, .COM.CN, .NET.CN, .ORG.CN, .TEL, .AU, .COM.AU, .NET.AU, .UK, .QUEBEC, .ORG.UK, .CO.UK, .ME.UK, .RU, .COM.RU, .NET.RU, .ORG.RU, .ONG, .NGO, .COM.BR, .NZ, .NL, .CO.NZ, .NET.NZ, .ORG.NZ, .MX, .COM.MX, .ORG.MX, .SCOT</li>
                  <li>You will need funds in your customer advance account to register domain names using this tool. Your current customer advance account balance is ₹ 0.00. You can add funds to your customer advance account by cpcking here.</li>
                  <li>Unpke the standard registration process, this method bypasses the check availabipty step and directly registers the domain names that you specify, if available.</li>
                  <li>his tool is highly optimized to register domain names in bulk. It will instantly submit all domain names to the respective registry using high-speed, multi-threaded connections thereby maximizing the chances of getting the domain names that you want. However, it may take several hours before these domain names start appearing in your control panel.</li>
                  <li>You will receive an email report which shows the status (successfully registered/domain unavailable) of all the domain names submitted by you at <a href="https://www.rctheme.com/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="137b7c60677a7d747b667153747e727a7f3d707c7e">[email&#160;protected]</a>.</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="feedback-section-nine position-relative z-1 pt-120 xl-pt-100 lg-pt-70 pb-130 lg-pb-80 ">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="text-center mb-70 lg-mb-30">
        <h2><span class="counter">12,0000</span>+</h2>
        <p class="fs-28  opacity-75">Customer love our product with more 20+ years reparation</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="feedback-slider-six">
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s reliable hosting and stellar support have been crucial for our startup’s growth.”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Sarah J.</span> Business Co-Founder</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s has boosted our site’s performance and reliability. Their support is excellent!”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Mike R.</span> Business Owner</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s offers great value and dependable service for my blog. Managing it has never been easier.”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">Emily T.</span> Blogger</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="item">
          <div class="feedback-block">
            <blockquote>“1Only Host’s has ensured our online presence runs smoothly with their dedicated service. We’re grateful!”</blockquote>
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between">
              <div class="name "><span class="fw-500">John K.</span> Business Director</div>
              <img src="/images/icon-quote.svg" alt="" class="icon"> </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <ul class="slider-arrows slick-arrow-one d-flex justify-content-center style-none mt-50">
        <li class="prev_b slick-arrow"><i class="icon icon-arrow-left"></i></li>
        <li class="next_b slick-arrow"><i class="icon icon-arrow-right"></i></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
